<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AUTOQUIP LIFTS INTERIM SHR, NO DIV.</title>
<headline>AUTOQUIP LIFTS INTERIM SHR, NO DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31,</p>
<p>1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	17.7	  vs	14.8</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    1.94	  vs	1.62</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    2.89	  vs	2.31</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.81	  vs	0.55</p>
<p>    Finance charges	  1.46	  vs	0.93</p>
<p>    Turnover		  47.93	  vs	45.22</p>
<p>Full name: Autoquip Group Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company did not declare a dividend but said it</p>
<p>expected to post one at the end of the financial year, depending</p>
<p>on the results and liquidity of the company. It said it expected</p>
<p>real earnings growth for the second half.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
